{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t數碼通表示，留意到部分地區的網絡服務出現不穩定情況，現正積極調查及跟進，並會盡力減低對客戶的影響。<br/>\n<br/>\n數碼通在社交專頁說，如有進一步消息，會適時公佈。就事件對客戶造成的不便，公司深表歉意。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：陳樂謙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:22:38.697924+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:05:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T21:17:55.147384+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:16:03.360471+00:00","content_hash":"679f0af52f15e068525fd1b14a8d05a87473a4863631c2cf497e2c3621b4b504","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}